## Anti-Slop Checklist

**CRITICAL**: Before finalizing design tokens, verify against AI slop patterns.

**Typography** (load `frontend-aesthetics` for alternatives):
- [ ] NO Inter, Roboto, Arial, Open Sans, Lato, system fonts
- [ ] Weight contrast: 200/800 extremes (NOT timid 400/600)
- [ ] Size jumps: 3x+ scale (NOT 1.5x)
- [ ] High-contrast pairings (serif + sans, display + mono)

**Colors**:
- [ ] NO purple gradients on white backgrounds
- [ ] NO generic blue SaaS schemes
- [ ] Dominant color + sharp accent (NOT evenly distributed palette)
- [ ] Context-specific identity (NOT "on distribution" choices)

**Layout**:
- [ ] NO excessive centering
- [ ] NO cookie-cutter component patterns
- [ ] NO uniform rounded corners everywhere

**Validation**: Run `improving-visuals` skill to score design choices (target ≥75/100)

