## Content

### Voice and Tone

- [Characteristic 1: e.g., "Direct and helpful"]
- [Characteristic 2: e.g., "Professional but approachable"]
- [Characteristic 3: e.g., "Concise, never verbose"]

### Microcopy Guidelines

| Element | Guideline | Example |
|---------|-----------|---------|
| Button labels | Action verbs, 1-2 words | Save, Create project |
| Error messages | Explain what happened + how to fix | "Email invalid. Check format." |
| Empty states | Brief status, not marketing | "No items yet" |
| Placeholders | Example format, not instructions | "name@example.com" |
| Confirmations | State outcome | "Project created" |

